  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 782.07 Previous Offenses. If a person has not committed the same offense in 7 years, the next offense shall be considered as a first offense.\n\nSource. #14059 EMERGENCY, EXPIRED: 2-15-25\n\nNew. #14287, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35\n\nAPPENDIX",
